(5991977, 878076, 59029, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the crazy world of high-level eventing, grease on the legs and all...this looks like a CCI. Where did you shoot?  <br/> <br/>Another 1/100th of a second later and you probably would have had an excellent 3/4 shot of the entire horse and rider.  Also, I wouldn''t have bothered mentioning barrels in the title, I think many people are going to be expecting to see a barrel racer.  Still, I know how hard it is to get a good shot of a horse and rider esp when they''re going at Mach 3 like this pair!</td>', 'Ahh, the crazy world of high-level eventing, grease on the legs and all...this looks like a CCI. Where did you shoot?   Another 1/100th of a second later and you probably would have had an excellent 3/4 shot of the entire horse and rider.  Also, I wouldn''t have bothered mentioning barrels in the title, I think many people are going to be expecting to see a barrel racer.  Still, I know how hard it is to get a good shot of a horse and rider esp when they''re going at Mach 3 like this pair!', '2010-05-05 10:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
