(5993339, 878219, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool catch. I think it could have done a bit better with sharper focus (or maybe some sharpness added via post processing).</td>', 'Cool catch. I think it could have done a bit better with sharper focus (or maybe some sharpness added via post processing).', '2010-05-05 23:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993341, 877736, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the grip on the ball. I think I would have cropped out a bit of his behind.</td>', 'Nice shot of the grip on the ball. I think I would have cropped out a bit of his behind.', '2010-05-05 23:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993342, 878325, 97270, '<td valign="top">I know many will complain that subjects are out of focus here. But that to me is intentional (right?) and is the essence of this image. I also love the fringe in the top right corner, and the partly-in-focus grass patch. Well done! 8/10.</td>', 'I know many will complain that subjects are out of focus here. But that to me is intentional (right?) and is the essence of this image. I also love the fringe in the top right corner, and the partly-in-focus grass patch. Well done! 8/10.', '2010-05-05 23:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993344, 876904, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the looks on their faces. I don''t like the high level of noise.</td>', 'I like the looks on their faces. I don''t like the high level of noise.', '2010-05-05 23:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993345, 877892, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I wonder what sport this is.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I wonder what sport this is.', '2010-05-05 23:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993346, 878440, 97270, '<td valign="top">Only one word. Personality! Well done. I would have cropped it a bit more tightly to avoid distraction from the background, OR I would have used a lower aperture (f-value) to cause more blurring of the background if possible. You get an 8/10.</td>', 'Only one word. Personality! Well done. I would have cropped it a bit more tightly to avoid distraction from the background, OR I would have used a lower aperture (f-value) to cause more blurring of the background if possible. You get an 8/10.', '2010-05-05 23:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993347, 878246, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool. Is that a wet ball or sweat bouncing off his head?</td>', 'That''s pretty cool. Is that a wet ball or sweat bouncing off his head?', '2010-05-05 23:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993349, 876088, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Most bowling alleys don''t seem that bright, so I wonder if you could have brought down brightness in post, and still kept the ghosts.</td>', 'Cool idea. Most bowling alleys don''t seem that bright, so I wonder if you could have brought down brightness in post, and still kept the ghosts.', '2010-05-05 23:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993351, 876508, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I do kind of wish the guy in the back wasn''t there, he''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot. I do kind of wish the guy in the back wasn''t there, he''s a bit distracting.', '2010-05-05 23:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993353, 878064, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of title for a shot like this. Really helps the story behind of the photo.<br/>I don''t really count skateboarding as a sport (more like an activity), but I didn''t vote lower because of it.</td>', 'Great use of title for a shot like this. Really helps the story behind of the photo.I don''t really count skateboarding as a sport (more like an activity), but I didn''t vote lower because of it.', '2010-05-05 23:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
