(5993357, 877696, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun take on the challenge. I think some of my team''s pitchers should learn that one.</td>', 'Fun take on the challenge. I think some of my team''s pitchers should learn that one.', '2010-05-05 23:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
