(5993422, 875643, 97270, '<td valign="top">Great that you could get so close to the subjects. Interesting angle. Would have been more interesting if you lied down in the sand (I assume you sat to take this?). I wish the people from the background would disappear, but wont complain since its a basic editing only challenge. You get a 7/10. Good job!</td>', 'Great that you could get so close to the subjects. Interesting angle. Would have been more interesting if you lied down in the sand (I assume you sat to take this?). I wish the people from the background would disappear, but wont complain since its a basic editing only challenge. You get a 7/10. Good job!', '2010-05-06 00:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993424, 878192, 97270, '<td valign="top">Clear. Sharp. Great DOF. Wondering if the shot would have more impact if the lens was looking directly at the face (from the right?). 8/10.</td>', 'Clear. Sharp. Great DOF. Wondering if the shot would have more impact if the lens was looking directly at the face (from the right?). 8/10.', '2010-05-06 00:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
