(5993428, 878223, 97270, '<td valign="top">Ok this one gets an 8. I have no complains with it, good composition, layering of subjects, sharp, ''action'' in the moment.</td>', 'Ok this one gets an 8. I have no complains with it, good composition, layering of subjects, sharp, ''action'' in the moment.', '2010-05-06 00:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
