(5993431, 877745, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good capture of live action as opposed to studio setups! So even though it is kind of not from a great angle, I give it a 7 for the effort to to go out to the game and try to catch one good moment from many many tries (how many did you shoot before you got this?):-)</td>', 'Good capture of live action as opposed to studio setups! So even though it is kind of not from a great angle, I give it a 7 for the effort to to go out to the game and try to catch one good moment from many many tries (how many did you shoot before you got this?):-)', '2010-05-06 00:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993433, 876555, 114285, '<td valign="top">GO FOOTY. GOOD MARK.</td>', 'GO FOOTY. GOOD MARK.', '2010-05-06 00:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993434, 878320, 97270, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a story telling shot right there! The smoke just adds to the magic. I have to upgrade it to an 8 looking at the moment that you caught. Great job!</td>', 'Now that''s a story telling shot right there! The smoke just adds to the magic. I have to upgrade it to an 8 looking at the moment that you caught. Great job!', '2010-05-06 00:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993440, 878319, 97270, '<td valign="top">Urrrmmmmm ok. Now you are putting me in a dubious situation. Fishing is a sport, yes. So technically you capture action from a sport. However, it is more of a vacation-y picture, doesn''t bring the word ''action'' to mind at the first glance. Great picture by the way, no complaints about any of the technical stuff. Great time of the day, love the silhouettes, and the three models, and how they create symmetry. I will take away one point just because of the other points I mentioned before. 7/10.</td>', 'Urrrmmmmm ok. Now you are putting me in a dubious situation. Fishing is a sport, yes. So technically you capture action from a sport. However, it is more of a vacation-y picture, doesn''t bring the word ''action'' to mind at the first glance. Great picture by the way, no complaints about any of the technical stuff. Great time of the day, love the silhouettes, and the three models, and how they create symmetry. I will take away one point just because of the other points I mentioned before. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 00:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993444, 878303, 97270, '<td valign="top">Ok. Except for the flying dust, I do not see any thing that causes a great impact in this picture. Would have helped if one of the two had their face towards the lens... or perhaps a different angle would have helped. As it is, I rate it a 6/10.</td>', 'Ok. Except for the flying dust, I do not see any thing that causes a great impact in this picture. Would have helped if one of the two had their face towards the lens... or perhaps a different angle would have helped. As it is, I rate it a 6/10.', '2010-05-06 00:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993449, 878227, 97270, '<td valign="top">Action, yes. Colors, good. Theme, yes. Aesthetic appeal, not so much. Good job. 6/10.</td>', 'Action, yes. Colors, good. Theme, yes. Aesthetic appeal, not so much. Good job. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 00:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993453, 878423, 97270, '<td valign="top">Did you mean to enter it in the other challenge (sports without a team)? I do not see how this captures a sport in ''action''. Good picture technically though. Just because of the other reason though, I have to rate it a 5.</td>', 'Did you mean to enter it in the other challenge (sports without a team)? I do not see how this captures a sport in ''action''. Good picture technically though. Just because of the other reason though, I have to rate it a 5.', '2010-05-06 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
