(5993498, 878439, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Blurry though (I know it is hard to take pics like this, but I have seen better). Shows the spirit of competition. Like it. 7/10.</td>', 'Good capture. Blurry though (I know it is hard to take pics like this, but I have seen better). Shows the spirit of competition. Like it. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993501, 878336, 15574, '<td valign="top">Nice! That shot is at the EXACT same time as the one that''s hitting the web and tv.</td>', 'Nice! That shot is at the EXACT same time as the one that''s hitting the web and tv.', '2010-05-06 01:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993545, 878417, 97270, '<td valign="top">The best part about this picture is the eye contact. Also love the shallow depth of field and composition of the scene. However, since it misses any real ''action'', I am gonna have to give it only a 7. Good job though!</td>', 'The best part about this picture is the eye contact. Also love the shallow depth of field and composition of the scene. However, since it misses any real ''action'', I am gonna have to give it only a 7. Good job though!', '2010-05-06 01:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993559, 877824, 97270, '<td valign="top">The face is hidden but it doesn''t stop this picture from being one of the top action shots in this challenge. well composed, great angle. 7/10.</td>', 'The face is hidden but it doesn''t stop this picture from being one of the top action shots in this challenge. well composed, great angle. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993574, 877734, 97270, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone does wonders here. Both models are indulged in the scene, telling me that it is a spontaneous shot, not a posed one. I fail to see that gripping action moment here though. 7/10.</td>', 'Sepia tone does wonders here. Both models are indulged in the scene, telling me that it is a spontaneous shot, not a posed one. I fail to see that gripping action moment here though. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993577, 877857, 97270, '<td valign="top">I know it is hard to get shots like these. So given that, I am going to ignore the slight blurring and asymmetry in this picture. 7/10.</td>', 'I know it is hard to get shots like these. So given that, I am going to ignore the slight blurring and asymmetry in this picture. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993579, 878374, 97270, '<td valign="top">This one gets an upgrade from me. A good action shot. Candid. Sharp, in focus. 8/10.</td>', 'This one gets an upgrade from me. A good action shot. Candid. Sharp, in focus. 8/10.', '2010-05-06 01:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993586, 878237, 97270, '<td valign="top">I get what you are trying to do here with shape, symmetry, and abstraction. But it didn''t quire hit the home run for me. You will however get points for creativity and thinking out of the box. Minus one for lack of any ''action'', which goes against what the theme suggested (Capture the action of any sport.). 6/10.</td>', 'I get what you are trying to do here with shape, symmetry, and abstraction. But it didn''t quire hit the home run for me. You will however get points for creativity and thinking out of the box. Minus one for lack of any ''action'', which goes against what the theme suggested (Capture the action of any sport.). 6/10.', '2010-05-06 01:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993588, 878207, 97270, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot. Don''t know how I can suggest to make it better.. shots like these are hard to get. A higher shutter speed may be? To give finer sand/grain freeze control? 6/10.</td>', 'Great candid shot. Don''t know how I can suggest to make it better.. shots like these are hard to get. A higher shutter speed may be? To give finer sand/grain freeze control? 6/10.', '2010-05-06 01:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993590, 878095, 97270, '<td valign="top">Another one of those rare pictures that get a score upgrade from me in the second round. Great symmetry, leading lines, exposure, lack of distracting background, good colors. 8/10 for you my friend!</td>', 'Another one of those rare pictures that get a score upgrade from me in the second round. Great symmetry, leading lines, exposure, lack of distracting background, good colors. 8/10 for you my friend!', '2010-05-06 01:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993595, 877108, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Love how he is looking at the ball and is so focussed. Good centered composition. 7/10.</td>', 'Good shot. Love how he is looking at the ball and is so focussed. Good centered composition. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993597, 878251, 97270, '<td valign="top">Part of me says you could have cropped the left part of the image and gotten one more point from me:-) Good capture, though not very much in focus (relative to some of the other ones I have seen). regardless, you get a 7/10. Good job!</td>', 'Part of me says you could have cropped the left part of the image and gotten one more point from me:-) Good capture, though not very much in focus (relative to some of the other ones I have seen). regardless, you get a 7/10. Good job!', '2010-05-06 01:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993598, 877818, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good capture. I would have cropped it a bit more tightly from the right though. 6/10.</td>', 'Good capture. I would have cropped it a bit more tightly from the right though. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 01:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993600, 875740, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Just enough post processing. Looks a bit posed though. 6/10.</td>', 'Good capture. Just enough post processing. Looks a bit posed though. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 01:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993604, 875760, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good try. The impact is lost though in the lack of ''pop-up'' of the subject and the blurriness. 6/10.</td>', 'Good try. The impact is lost though in the lack of ''pop-up'' of the subject and the blurriness. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 01:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993605, 878225, 97270, '<td valign="top">What a clean shot. Really does capture action in a sport. 7/10.</td>', 'What a clean shot. Really does capture action in a sport. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993608, 877808, 97270, '<td valign="top">Some true action going on here. Good shot! 7/10.</td>', 'Some true action going on here. Good shot! 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993611, 877237, 97270, '<td valign="top">Ok you get an upgrade from me. Well composed, well lit, true action. 8/10.</td>', 'Ok you get an upgrade from me. Well composed, well lit, true action. 8/10.', '2010-05-06 01:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993614, 877191, 97270, '<td valign="top">Clean. Good action. Leading line(s). Good exposure. 7/10.</td>', 'Clean. Good action. Leading line(s). Good exposure. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993617, 878012, 97270, '<td valign="top">Interesting and bold. Love the B&amp;W. Lacks ''action'' though (refer to the challenge theme). Still like the crude feel. 6/10.</td>', 'Interesting and bold. Love the B&W. Lacks ''action'' though (refer to the challenge theme). Still like the crude feel. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 01:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993622, 877736, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good capture! Love the way blurry background suggests some interested and other disinterested spectators. Well done! 7/10.</td>', 'Good capture! Love the way blurry background suggests some interested and other disinterested spectators. Well done! 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993624, 877713, 97270, '<td valign="top">Oh how I wish I could see the ball leave his foot up in the air! Still a very good shot. I also wonder if there was a tad better angle to avoid the people in the background. 6/10.</td>', 'Oh how I wish I could see the ball leave his foot up in the air! Still a very good shot. I also wonder if there was a tad better angle to avoid the people in the background. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 01:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993627, 876174, 97270, '<td valign="top">This picture would be worth a 10.0 score if only you had the diver half way in the air. Good shot. 6/10.</td>', 'This picture would be worth a 10.0 score if only you had the diver half way in the air. Good shot. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 01:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993629, 876787, 97270, '<td valign="top">One of the better ''cricket'' captures. Good job! 7/10.</td>', 'One of the better ''cricket'' captures. Good job! 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993633, 878245, 97270, '<td valign="top">Great sunset. Great silhouettes. One of the best pics of this challenge. Unfortunately, doesn''t show the ''real'' action of fishing as a sport, and looks all setup. You still get 7/10 from me. Good job!</td>', 'Great sunset. Great silhouettes. One of the best pics of this challenge. Unfortunately, doesn''t show the ''real'' action of fishing as a sport, and looks all setup. You still get 7/10 from me. Good job!', '2010-05-06 01:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993635, 878444, 97270, '<td valign="top">A great capture! Love the fisheye effect. Well composed. Just a tad over exposed I think. 7/10.</td>', 'A great capture! Love the fisheye effect. Well composed. Just a tad over exposed I think. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 01:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993637, 878081, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good capture. But looks setup, not candid. Contrast could have been better. Like the fact that you managed to get the ball in the scene. 6/10.</td>', 'Good capture. But looks setup, not candid. Contrast could have been better. Like the fact that you managed to get the ball in the scene. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 01:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993638, 877097, 97270, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot! Love the dirt flying around the hooves! Would have loved it on B&amp;W more. 7/10.</td>', 'Great candid shot! Love the dirt flying around the hooves! Would have loved it on B&W more. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 02:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993643, 878181, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good scene capture. Good and well defined leading lines. Love the nitty details on the pavement. Just a tad over processed for my taste but then again I have been accused of that too, so never mind that. 7/10.</td>', 'Good scene capture. Good and well defined leading lines. Love the nitty details on the pavement. Just a tad over processed for my taste but then again I have been accused of that too, so never mind that. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 02:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993644, 877815, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good action shot! Good symmetry. Lacks details though. 6/10.</td>', 'Good action shot! Good symmetry. Lacks details though. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 02:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993647, 876548, 97270, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful action shot! I understand better framing wont be easy from where you  took this picture. 7/10.</td>', 'What a wonderful action shot! I understand better framing wont be easy from where you  took this picture. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 02:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993649, 878045, 97270, '<td valign="top">A beautiful capture, but insufficient crop. I understand you wanted to show the other half of the shadow and so left the right portion of the picture intact? Regardless, a good capture. 7/10.</td>', 'A beautiful capture, but insufficient crop. I understand you wanted to show the other half of the shadow and so left the right portion of the picture intact? Regardless, a good capture. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993651, 877611, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good shot! May have been better in B&amp;W? Love the splashes! Good job! 7/10.</td>', 'Good shot! May have been better in B&W? Love the splashes! Good job! 7/10.', '2010-05-06 02:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993654, 876404, 97270, '<td valign="top">This shot will get an upgrade in score from me. Great pose, great moving lines, great form. I just wish she was more centered. 7/10!</td>', 'This shot will get an upgrade in score from me. Great pose, great moving lines, great form. I just wish she was more centered. 7/10!', '2010-05-06 02:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993656, 877306, 97270, '<td valign="top">Sharp, clean, great colors, AND it has action. 7/10!</td>', 'Sharp, clean, great colors, AND it has action. 7/10!', '2010-05-06 02:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993660, 878069, 97270, '<td valign="top">Uhhhmmm...good picture, nice angle, nice colors; though it looks posed. 6/10.</td>', 'Uhhhmmm...good picture, nice angle, nice colors; though it looks posed. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 02:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993662, 876452, 97270, '<td valign="top">What a nice shot! You captured the splash nicely. 7/10.</td>', 'What a nice shot! You captured the splash nicely. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 02:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993664, 878306, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good angle. Though a little blurry. 6/10.</td>', 'Good composition, good angle. Though a little blurry. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 02:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993667, 878092, 97270, '<td valign="top">Oye oye oye. One of the rare action packed shots. Great capture. I just wish you had the angle a differently oriented, diagonally perhaps?? You get an 7/10 from me!</td>', 'Oye oye oye. One of the rare action packed shots. Great capture. I just wish you had the angle a differently oriented, diagonally perhaps?? You get an 7/10 from me!', '2010-05-06 02:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993708, 877064, 97270, '<td valign="top">Wow! Interesting perspective. Good capture, though could have been sharper (I know it is hard to do, so you will get credit). 7/10.</td>', 'Wow! Interesting perspective. Good capture, though could have been sharper (I know it is hard to do, so you will get credit). 7/10.', '2010-05-06 03:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993711, 878108, 97270, '<td valign="top">This picture screams ACTION to me. Great shot! Love the mud+water splashes...nice centered composition. You get an 8 from me!</td>', 'This picture screams ACTION to me. Great shot! Love the mud+water splashes...nice centered composition. You get an 8 from me!', '2010-05-06 03:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993715, 878432, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good picture! The one comment I would have is to have used a different angle/perspective to possibly avoid the background noise (the people). Perhaps one which is looking up from ground below? Not sure. Definitely captures action, so you get credit for that. 6/10.</td>', 'Good picture! The one comment I would have is to have used a different angle/perspective to possibly avoid the background noise (the people). Perhaps one which is looking up from ground below? Not sure. Definitely captures action, so you get credit for that. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 03:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993718, 877783, 97270, '<td valign="top">Don''t get me wrong. This picture has most of the elements of a wowing image (it has patterns, lines, symmetry, and its B&amp;W). However, there is just too much going on here. Perhaps focusing on just one/two subjects would have helped? Still a good shot. 6/10.</td>', 'Don''t get me wrong. This picture has most of the elements of a wowing image (it has patterns, lines, symmetry, and its B&W). However, there is just too much going on here. Perhaps focusing on just one/two subjects would have helped? Still a good shot. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 03:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993720, 877884, 97270, '<td valign="top">Yes I do see intensity. And I see action. The one bummer for me though is how the heads of a few players are chopped off. Not sure if this how it was framed or it''s an intentional crop. Regardless, a pretty good image, that fits the challenge theme. 6/10.</td>', 'Yes I do see intensity. And I see action. The one bummer for me though is how the heads of a few players are chopped off. Not sure if this how it was framed or it''s an intentional crop. Regardless, a pretty good image, that fits the challenge theme. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 03:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993724, 877773, 97270, '<td valign="top">I can imagine how hard it must be to capture this one. And you will be rewarded for that. My one gotcha here is that something else towards the lower half of the image blocked the most interesting part of the action: the wheels! Still a tough one, good colors, and it depicts ''real action'' as opposed to a posed/seup one. You get a 7 from me.</td>', 'I can imagine how hard it must be to capture this one. And you will be rewarded for that. My one gotcha here is that something else towards the lower half of the image blocked the most interesting part of the action: the wheels! Still a tough one, good colors, and it depicts ''real action'' as opposed to a posed/seup one. You get a 7 from me.', '2010-05-06 03:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993726, 876770, 97270, '<td valign="top">Ok on a second thought, you do get an upgrade in score from me. I think you are definitely worth an 8. You have symmetry, leading lines, clarity, focus, good colors, and the picture has a personality. Enjoy your new score: 8/10!</td>', 'Ok on a second thought, you do get an upgrade in score from me. I think you are definitely worth an 8. You have symmetry, leading lines, clarity, focus, good colors, and the picture has a personality. Enjoy your new score: 8/10!', '2010-05-06 03:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993728, 877982, 97270, '<td valign="top">Action: yes. Composition: good. The vibrant colors: not sure about that. Difficulty of getting the shot: not too high. Decent shot. Good job! 6/10.</td>', 'Action: yes. Composition: good. The vibrant colors: not sure about that. Difficulty of getting the shot: not too high. Decent shot. Good job! 6/10.', '2010-05-06 03:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993729, 876949, 97270, '<td valign="top">Another candidate for an upgrade. Good story in the picture. Meets the challenge. Captures ''real'' action. My only peeve is with cropping/framing. The chopped off guy to the left distracts me. Still a good shot. 6/10.</td>', 'Another candidate for an upgrade. Good story in the picture. Meets the challenge. Captures ''real'' action. My only peeve is with cropping/framing. The chopped off guy to the left distracts me. Still a good shot. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 03:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993732, 877651, 97270, '<td valign="top">I want to score this image high. But the extra softness (intentional??) and lack of a clear focus an a subject stop me from doing so. Definitely meets the challenge, and you will get credit for that. I rate it 5/10.</td>', 'I want to score this image high. But the extra softness (intentional??) and lack of a clear focus an a subject stop me from doing so. Definitely meets the challenge, and you will get credit for that. I rate it 5/10.', '2010-05-06 03:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993737, 878402, 97270, '<td valign="top">Aaargh. Such a great shot, partly ruined by a crop/framing error? If it had the whole body in the frame, I would rate it a 9+ right away! In lieu of that, I am forced to rate it as a 7/10. Great picture otherwise dude/dudette, love the motion blur and background haze:-)</td>', 'Aaargh. Such a great shot, partly ruined by a crop/framing error? If it had the whole body in the frame, I would rate it a 9+ right away! In lieu of that, I am forced to rate it as a 7/10. Great picture otherwise dude/dudette, love the motion blur and background haze:-)', '2010-05-06 03:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993740, 877010, 97270, '<td valign="top">Great image. And I dont even mind that his head is copped away. It definitely captures action. Although I wish the ball was in the frame too. Good colors. 7/10.</td>', 'Great image. And I dont even mind that his head is copped away. It definitely captures action. Although I wish the ball was in the frame too. Good colors. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 04:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993742, 877347, 97270, '<td valign="top">Great shot. My only peeve with it is that it doesn''t depict ''action'' from a sport. I love the interplay of textures, lines, and shapes. 6/10.</td>', 'Great shot. My only peeve with it is that it doesn''t depict ''action'' from a sport. I love the interplay of textures, lines, and shapes. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993745, 878332, 97270, '<td valign="top">A lil more cropping on the right side may have made it score at least 2 points higher from me. Nice capture of running action. 6/10.</td>', 'A lil more cropping on the right side may have made it score at least 2 points higher from me. Nice capture of running action. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993749, 878354, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good action shot. I like the personality the kids bring to the image. 6/10.</td>', 'Good action shot. I like the personality the kids bring to the image. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993750, 877856, 97270, '<td valign="top">Oh what a nice shot! A tad underexposed though. 6/10.</td>', 'Oh what a nice shot! A tad underexposed though. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993751, 877928, 97270, '<td valign="top">That''s what I am talking about! Action, colors, story. 7/10.</td>', 'That''s what I am talking about! Action, colors, story. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 04:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993752, 878018, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good picture. I dont know how else you would have captured a different perspective but by putting the camera on the surfer. 6/10.</td>', 'Good picture. I dont know how else you would have captured a different perspective but by putting the camera on the surfer. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993756, 878333, 97270, '<td valign="top">Action? Good and creative thinking though. Like the DOF effect And the symmetry in the image. 6/10.</td>', 'Action? Good and creative thinking though. Like the DOF effect And the symmetry in the image. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993757, 877875, 97270, '<td valign="top">Nice angle! Almost looks like the dude in green shirt got the other one by his neck:-) 7/10.</td>', 'Nice angle! Almost looks like the dude in green shirt got the other one by his neck:-) 7/10.', '2010-05-06 04:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993759, 878285, 97270, '<td valign="top">Crisp. Clear. Misses action. But tells a story. 6/10.</td>', 'Crisp. Clear. Misses action. But tells a story. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993771, 878324, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good action, definitely meets the challenge, and is a candid shot. Not as sharp an image though. Hard to say what part of the image is in primary focus. 6/10.</td>', 'Good action, definitely meets the challenge, and is a candid shot. Not as sharp an image though. Hard to say what part of the image is in primary focus. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993773, 877606, 97270, '<td valign="top">Ayiyiyiyi.... another good one! You get an upgrade from a 6 to an 8 from me. It has real action, it is in focus, and has good composition too!</td>', 'Ayiyiyiyi.... another good one! You get an upgrade from a 6 to an 8 from me. It has real action, it is in focus, and has good composition too!', '2010-05-06 04:24:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5993775, 878076, 97270, '<td valign="top">Ouch! Why is the crop so brutal? On purpose? This could have been a great image if more of the ''action'' was in the frame. 5/10.</td>', 'Ouch! Why is the crop so brutal? On purpose? This could have been a great image if more of the ''action'' was in the frame. 5/10.', '2010-05-06 04:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993776, 876508, 97270, '<td valign="top">Sharp, in focus, real action, good personality. Dont know why I would rate it lower than an 8. Enjoy:-)</td>', 'Sharp, in focus, real action, good personality. Dont know why I would rate it lower than an 8. Enjoy:-)', '2010-05-06 04:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993777, 878380, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good attempt. Looks posed/setup though. Doesn''t have enough real ''action'' compared to some of the other entries. Also, you could have used the ring lines (red/white/blue) to your advantage by shooting from a corner and making them the leading lines. As it is right now, I rate it a 5/10.</td>', 'Good attempt. Looks posed/setup though. Doesn''t have enough real ''action'' compared to some of the other entries. Also, you could have used the ring lines (red/white/blue) to your advantage by shooting from a corner and making them the leading lines. As it is right now, I rate it a 5/10.', '2010-05-06 04:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993780, 878044, 97270, '<td valign="top">Nice timing! Focus slightly off because of panning I guess?? Meets the challenge, and captures real action. 6/10.</td>', 'Nice timing! Focus slightly off because of panning I guess?? Meets the challenge, and captures real action. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993782, 876872, 97270, '<td valign="top">This is a picture that tells a story. It''s not just a snapshot. What it is, is a book that will take you to each of it''s characters (the kids) and to what they are thinking right this moment. Loved the way you decided to keep it B&amp;W. 7/10!</td>', 'This is a picture that tells a story. It''s not just a snapshot. What it is, is a book that will take you to each of it''s characters (the kids) and to what they are thinking right this moment. Loved the way you decided to keep it B&W. 7/10!', '2010-05-06 04:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993783, 876523, 97270, '<td valign="top">I like how you caught him in mid air. Good composition too (leading lines/stairs). 6/10.</td>', 'I like how you caught him in mid air. Good composition too (leading lines/stairs). 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993784, 875415, 97270, '<td valign="top">It has action, and emotions. Well cone! 6/10.</td>', 'It has action, and emotions. Well cone! 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993786, 878239, 97270, '<td valign="top">Oh nice capture! I was dying to see a ball flying away in the same frame, thank you. I would have cropped the bottom part of the image to pan more to the top if I could. 7/10.</td>', 'Oh nice capture! I was dying to see a ball flying away in the same frame, thank you. I would have cropped the bottom part of the image to pan more to the top if I could. 7/10.', '2010-05-06 04:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993792, 878209, 97270, '<td valign="top">Form, lines, composition, action. You have it all. I only would have wished to see it in B&amp;W (may be I am biased:-). 7/10.</td>', 'Form, lines, composition, action. You have it all. I only would have wished to see it in B&W (may be I am biased:-). 7/10.', '2010-05-06 04:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993793, 877306, 23394, '<td valign="top">great moment, nice work with the exposure.  in reality, you could have cut the photo in half, delivering simply a vertical of the batter.  the tendency is to include the whole thing, but all the dead space in the middle is too distracting.</td>', 'great moment, nice work with the exposure.  in reality, you could have cut the photo in half, delivering simply a vertical of the batter.  the tendency is to include the whole thing, but all the dead space in the middle is too distracting.', '2010-05-06 04:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993794, 876492, 97270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! 6/10.</td>', 'Nice shot! 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993797, 875993, 97270, '<td valign="top">Sorry looks like a set up shot, not candid enough for capturing real action (unless it is not, in which case let me know and I will apologize duly, but only aptly). Technically it a superb shot though, so you will get credit for that. 6/10.</td>', 'Sorry looks like a set up shot, not candid enough for capturing real action (unless it is not, in which case let me know and I will apologize duly, but only aptly). Technically it a superb shot though, so you will get credit for that. 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993798, 878116, 97270, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Love the symmetry. For some reason it is hazy (could be the beach, doh:-). 6/10.</td>', 'Nice capture! Love the symmetry. For some reason it is hazy (could be the beach, doh:-). 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993799, 876404, 23394, '<td valign="top">spot on shot.  fwiw, it has a sense of imbalance that could have been corrected with a tighter crop that centered the subject.  look how much more powerful it would have been cropped down to just above her head, over to her knee, and almost up to her foot.</td>', 'spot on shot.  fwiw, it has a sense of imbalance that could have been corrected with a tighter crop that centered the subject.  look how much more powerful it would have been cropped down to just above her head, over to her knee, and almost up to her foot.', '2010-05-06 04:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993800, 878328, 97270, '<td valign="top">Good one!!!!! 7/10.</td>', 'Good one!!!!! 7/10.', '2010-05-06 04:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993801, 878336, 97270, '<td valign="top">Hmm. I like your different take on action in a sport:-) 6/10.</td>', 'Hmm. I like your different take on action in a sport:-) 6/10.', '2010-05-06 04:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993802, 876088, 97270, '<td valign="top">Unique concept. I like it.</td>', 'Unique concept. I like it.', '2010-05-06 04:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993805, 877783, 23394, '<td valign="top">you have a technically perfect photo of...what?  you have a camera capable of capturing images in this environment, but i can''t tell what you''re shooting.  when you have so much going on in a place like that, you need to shoot with the shortest depth of field and find a spot where you can isolate a subject with minimal background distractions.</td>', 'you have a technically perfect photo of...what?  you have a camera capable of capturing images in this environment, but i can''t tell what you''re shooting.  when you have so much going on in a place like that, you need to shoot with the shortest depth of field and find a spot where you can isolate a subject with minimal background distractions.', '2010-05-06 04:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993806, 878171, 23394, '<td valign="top">alright, i''ll give you props for setting the shot up and executing it, but i''m not giving you any points for it.  if you have a racket and ball, i''d rather you have shot them actually being used in play, like, um, in action ;-)</td>', 'alright, i''ll give you props for setting the shot up and executing it, but i''m not giving you any points for it.  if you have a racket and ball, i''d rather you have shot them actually being used in play, like, um, in action ;-)', '2010-05-06 04:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993808, 877734, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like this and i don''t like it.  it''s rare to capture visual symmetry in sports - you really have to work for it - but, the sepia tone kills it for me.  bw would have been good, but sepia and action don''t mix that well.</td>', 'i like this and i don''t like it.  it''s rare to capture visual symmetry in sports - you really have to work for it - but, the sepia tone kills it for me.  bw would have been good, but sepia and action don''t mix that well.', '2010-05-06 04:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993812, 877347, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but dmnc.  pretty picture, but it''s more of a landscape with workout equipment than a sports action photo.  if you gotten right behind the guy, shooting up into the sun, or above him, you might have gotten something closer to meeting the challenge.</td>', 'sorry, but dmnc.  pretty picture, but it''s more of a landscape with workout equipment than a sports action photo.  if you gotten right behind the guy, shooting up into the sun, or above him, you might have gotten something closer to meeting the challenge.', '2010-05-06 04:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993822, 878437, 23394, '<td valign="top">that''s a really wild shot and it puts me on the edge in terms of meeting the challenge.  on one hand, it captures the action of a sport (and it does that extremely well).  on the other hand, it smacks of being a set up shot (as opposed to one captured in competition).  it will undoubtedly win over the dpc eye-candy crowd, but i''d prefer something caught in the wild.<br/> <br/>it''s just that it looks strobed to perfection; if i''m wrong, well, my apologies and congratulations on a killer shot...</td>', 'that''s a really wild shot and it puts me on the edge in terms of meeting the challenge.  on one hand, it captures the action of a sport (and it does that extremely well).  on the other hand, it smacks of being a set up shot (as opposed to one captured in competition).  it will undoubtedly win over the dpc eye-candy crowd, but i''d prefer something caught in the wild. it''s just that it looks strobed to perfection; if i''m wrong, well, my apologies and congratulations on a killer shot...', '2010-05-06 04:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993827, 878380, 23394, '<td valign="top">this looks like it has all the makings of a great shot, but there''s no action here.  this also looks like a situation where you could have safely held your camera just inside the ropes and gotten a shot without that distraction.</td>', 'this looks like it has all the makings of a great shot, but there''s no action here.  this also looks like a situation where you could have safely held your camera just inside the ropes and gotten a shot without that distraction.', '2010-05-06 05:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993832, 878116, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but a little flat.  it really needs more post-processing to make it pop.  surfing is tough to shoot in that it''s hard to get a really unique, dynamic image.</td>', 'nice idea, but a little flat.  it really needs more post-processing to make it pop.  surfing is tough to shoot in that it''s hard to get a really unique, dynamic image.', '2010-05-06 05:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993836, 878313, 23394, '<td valign="top">very nice work.  gotta love having the tools and access to shoot stuff like this, as well as when work and play come together ;-)<br/> <br/>there is only a small handful of people at dpc capable of a shot like this, and you''re one of them.</td>', 'very nice work.  gotta love having the tools and access to shoot stuff like this, as well as when work and play come together ;-) there is only a small handful of people at dpc capable of a shot like this, and you''re one of them.', '2010-05-06 05:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993840, 878333, 23394, '<td valign="top">i get where you were going, but that''s not going to get you much at dpc.  fwiw, i think a horizontal composition without as much dead space might have worked better.</td>', 'i get where you were going, but that''s not going to get you much at dpc.  fwiw, i think a horizontal composition without as much dead space might have worked better.', '2010-05-06 05:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993847, 878342, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice, all the way around!  good job getting the camera down to their eye level!</td>', 'nice, all the way around!  good job getting the camera down to their eye level!', '2010-05-06 05:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993850, 878284, 23394, '<td valign="top">i get what you''re after, but you should have driven out to an open area with no distracting backgrounds, where you could have isolated your subject.  that would have been you, ''hunting for the perfect shot'' ;-)</td>', 'i get what you''re after, but you should have driven out to an open area with no distracting backgrounds, where you could have isolated your subject.  that would have been you, ''hunting for the perfect shot'' ;-)', '2010-05-06 05:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993855, 877851, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is ok and it gets the point across, but it''s really artifacty.  you also could have cropped off the left all the way up to the right-hand side of the window...that light area outside REALLY distracts.</td>', 'this is ok and it gets the point across, but it''s really artifacty.  you also could have cropped off the left all the way up to the right-hand side of the window...that light area outside REALLY distracts.', '2010-05-06 05:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993858, 878219, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent moment, but seems to be a little out of reach for your lens.  the inherent softness takes away from an otherwise awesome shot.</td>', 'excellent moment, but seems to be a little out of reach for your lens.  the inherent softness takes away from an otherwise awesome shot.', '2010-05-06 05:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993864, 877010, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but not the right image to really convey sports action.  first rule is to try to include the ball.  if no ball, then a facial expression.  if no facial expression, a composition that is graphic in nature.  you''re almost there, but the composition is too imbalanced.  nice perspective, though.</td>', 'nice idea, but not the right image to really convey sports action.  first rule is to try to include the ball.  if no ball, then a facial expression.  if no facial expression, a composition that is graphic in nature.  you''re almost there, but the composition is too imbalanced.  nice perspective, though.', '2010-05-06 05:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993870, 878303, 23394, '<td valign="top">a much, much tighter crop could have made a couple points difference in your score.  you could have come down on the right guy''s head and all the way over to the fence post from the left and have had a much different image.</td>', 'a much, much tighter crop could have made a couple points difference in your score.  you could have come down on the right guy''s head and all the way over to the fence post from the left and have had a much different image.', '2010-05-06 05:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993875, 877005, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice moment! and great perspective!  could have really benefited from a tighter crop, almost banner-tight.  look at it cropped down to just below the top of the ball and up from the bottom to the middle of the three.  that would take the viewer right into the action.</td>', 'nice moment! and great perspective!  could have really benefited from a tighter crop, almost banner-tight.  look at it cropped down to just below the top of the ball and up from the bottom to the middle of the three.  that would take the viewer right into the action.', '2010-05-06 05:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993877, 878069, 23394, '<td valign="top">not bad.  good use of perspective, nice composition.  probably won''t do well scoring-wise, but at least you know how to take a better than average photo.</td>', 'not bad.  good use of perspective, nice composition.  probably won''t do well scoring-wise, but at least you know how to take a better than average photo.', '2010-05-06 05:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993884, 877244, 23394, '<td valign="top">this would have been so much better with a panorama crop, coming down to just above the background people''s heads.  as is, there''s too much distraction at the top.  also, as much as i like the quirkiness of it, it is hard to tell exactly what you were after with the shot.</td>', 'this would have been so much better with a panorama crop, coming down to just above the background people''s heads.  as is, there''s too much distraction at the top.  also, as much as i like the quirkiness of it, it is hard to tell exactly what you were after with the shot.', '2010-05-06 05:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993887, 876088, 23394, '<td valign="top">why?  why didn''t you take the camera up to the first seat and gone after the same type shot, but actually capture someone rolling the ball?  as is, it''s more of an environmental shot than an action shot.  great idea, though.</td>', 'why?  why didn''t you take the camera up to the first seat and gone after the same type shot, but actually capture someone rolling the ball?  as is, it''s more of an environmental shot than an action shot.  great idea, though.', '2010-05-06 05:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993890, 877892, 23394, '<td valign="top">sniff, sniff...what''s that i smell?  ah, an old SHOEHORN ;-)<br/> <br/>yes, it''s a nice documentary photo, but no, it''s not going to pry open the minds of the typical dpc voter looking for an action photo...</td>', 'sniff, sniff...what''s that i smell?  ah, an old SHOEHORN ;-) yes, it''s a nice documentary photo, but no, it''s not going to pry open the minds of the typical dpc voter looking for an action photo...', '2010-05-06 05:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993895, 876825, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent moment, but has too much wasted space.  should have cropped down to the top of the girl reaching down and over to the feet of the girl on the ground.  you could also possible benefit from shooting from a lower perspective.</td>', 'excellent moment, but has too much wasted space.  should have cropped down to the top of the girl reaching down and over to the feet of the girl on the ground.  you could also possible benefit from shooting from a lower perspective.', '2010-05-06 05:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993896, 877856, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but looks like it needs some real work in post-processing.</td>', 'nice idea, but looks like it needs some real work in post-processing.', '2010-05-06 05:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993899, 878237, 23394, '<td valign="top">great graphic image, but sorry, i can''t buy it for sports action...</td>', 'great graphic image, but sorry, i can''t buy it for sports action...', '2010-05-06 05:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993902, 878019, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but the reason this isn''t scoring well is that it looks like a photo anybody with a decent camera could take.  the key to scoring better is to put that camera to work, trying to capture images that not just anybody could take.</td>', 'sorry, but the reason this isn''t scoring well is that it looks like a photo anybody with a decent camera could take.  the key to scoring better is to put that camera to work, trying to capture images that not just anybody could take.', '2010-05-06 05:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993909, 877713, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice moment, bad crop.  if you had cropped out all the wasted space at the bottom, top, and on the left, you''d have a much more dynamic shot.  you can take a little league shot and put a big league crop on it and wind up with images that look tons better than what any of the other parents are taking.  you might also want to lower your perspective down to the player''s level, so that it doesn''t look like you''re shooting down on them.</td>', 'nice moment, bad crop.  if you had cropped out all the wasted space at the bottom, top, and on the left, you''d have a much more dynamic shot.  you can take a little league shot and put a big league crop on it and wind up with images that look tons better than what any of the other parents are taking.  you might also want to lower your perspective down to the player''s level, so that it doesn''t look like you''re shooting down on them.', '2010-05-06 05:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993912, 875760, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice try, but there''s just way too much going against this photo.  i''m expecting it to wind up fairly close to the bottom...that doesn''t mean quit trying, it just means this one probably ain''t gonna make it.</td>', 'nice try, but there''s just way too much going against this photo.  i''m expecting it to wind up fairly close to the bottom...that doesn''t mean quit trying, it just means this one probably ain''t gonna make it.', '2010-05-06 05:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993915, 876949, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, decent perspective, but needs a tighter crop.</td>', 'nice idea, decent perspective, but needs a tighter crop.', '2010-05-06 05:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993918, 876174, 23394, '<td valign="top">why?  why this image instead of waiting a quarter second or a half second?  it also seems a little soft and flat.  a little more post-processing (even in basic editing) could have done wonders.</td>', 'why?  why this image instead of waiting a quarter second or a half second?  it also seems a little soft and flat.  a little more post-processing (even in basic editing) could have done wonders.', '2010-05-06 05:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993921, 878006, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but this doesn''t work for me at all.  the tilt is too extreme to do anything but make me feel like i''m hurtling towards a crash.  very nice control on the pan, but not enough to overcome the uneasiness i''m getting.</td>', 'sorry, but this doesn''t work for me at all.  the tilt is too extreme to do anything but make me feel like i''m hurtling towards a crash.  very nice control on the pan, but not enough to overcome the uneasiness i''m getting.', '2010-05-06 05:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993923, 878170, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but this is boring.  it''s a snapshot of a crew team.  if you want to score better, you need to show me something i''m not going to see from the riverside.  either use a longer lens to take me all the way out there, or go down to the dock and get some close up action.  nice colors, and maybe a nice print, but not a high-scorer at dpc...</td>', 'sorry, but this is boring.  it''s a snapshot of a crew team.  if you want to score better, you need to show me something i''m not going to see from the riverside.  either use a longer lens to take me all the way out there, or go down to the dock and get some close up action.  nice colors, and maybe a nice print, but not a high-scorer at dpc...', '2010-05-06 05:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993926, 875993, 23394, '<td valign="top">i get your idea, but it would have been much, much more effective if your subject had at least been making an effort...</td>', 'i get your idea, but it would have been much, much more effective if your subject had at least been making an effort...', '2010-05-06 05:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993929, 877191, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough shot, but doubt if it''s going to win over the dpc crowd.  it''s more on the snapshot-of-a-skateboarder side than the WOW side.  you need to find a way to use that camera to capture things people don''t expect to see.</td>', 'nice enough shot, but doubt if it''s going to win over the dpc crowd.  it''s more on the snapshot-of-a-skateboarder side than the WOW side.  you need to find a way to use that camera to capture things people don''t expect to see.', '2010-05-06 05:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993931, 878106, 23394, '<td valign="top">i get the idea, but the execution looks more accidental than purposeful.  it''s like you knew what you wanted but the camera had a different plan.</td>', 'i get the idea, but the execution looks more accidental than purposeful.  it''s like you knew what you wanted but the camera had a different plan.', '2010-05-06 05:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993934, 877982, 23394, '<td valign="top">most of the time, the difference between a good shot and a great shot is how it''s cropped.  this is a little league shot that needs a big league crop.  great colors, great perspective, wonderful moment, nice composition, and, too, too, too much wasted space that distracts from your subject.  crop down to just above the kid''s glasses, crop into the arms, crop up to the bottom of the ball, and WOW - a completely different image!</td>', 'most of the time, the difference between a good shot and a great shot is how it''s cropped.  this is a little league shot that needs a big league crop.  great colors, great perspective, wonderful moment, nice composition, and, too, too, too much wasted space that distracts from your subject.  crop down to just above the kid''s glasses, crop into the arms, crop up to the bottom of the ball, and WOW - a completely different image!', '2010-05-06 05:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993936, 877064, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice work on a tough shot.  i probably should have cropped off almost the whole top half of the image, though.</td>', 'nice work on a tough shot.  i probably should have cropped off almost the whole top half of the image, though.', '2010-05-06 05:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993937, 877959, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but too soft and way too much wasted space.  it looks a lot better to me if you cropped it horizontal, coming all the way down to just under the top of the ball..</td>', 'nice idea, but too soft and way too much wasted space.  it looks a lot better to me if you cropped it horizontal, coming all the way down to just under the top of the ball..', '2010-05-06 05:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993938, 877827, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but needs work in post production.  first, don''t be afraid to crop.  all that stuff that''s not part of the action needs to go.  secondly, there are a ton of tools that you can use to bring out the image, to reveal the details in the shadows.  you''re on the right track, but you really have to work at it if your going to get the most out of what your camera can do...</td>', 'nice idea, but needs work in post production.  first, don''t be afraid to crop.  all that stuff that''s not part of the action needs to go.  secondly, there are a ton of tools that you can use to bring out the image, to reveal the details in the shadows.  you''re on the right track, but you really have to work at it if your going to get the most out of what your camera can do...', '2010-05-06 05:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993940, 877773, 23394, '<td valign="top">great graphic image, killed by basic editing.  if i were you, i would process the heck out of this thing and print it large and put it on a wall.  and i wouldn''t think twice about what it scored at dpc...</td>', 'great graphic image, killed by basic editing.  if i were you, i would process the heck out of this thing and print it large and put it on a wall.  and i wouldn''t think twice about what it scored at dpc...', '2010-05-06 06:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993941, 876692, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough shot, but doesn''t really grab my interest.  maybe a different perspective might have made a difference.  as is, this looks like something almost anyone with a decent camera could have taken...</td>', 'nice enough shot, but doesn''t really grab my interest.  maybe a different perspective might have made a difference.  as is, this looks like something almost anyone with a decent camera could have taken...', '2010-05-06 06:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993942, 877097, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice enough shot, but too much visual clutter.  also, the harshness of the lighting needs balancing.  you might take a look at applying some shadow/highlights.</td>', 'nice enough shot, but too much visual clutter.  also, the harshness of the lighting needs balancing.  you might take a look at applying some shadow/highlights.', '2010-05-06 06:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993943, 877611, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice moment, but seems a little soft and flat...doesn''t really pop for me as much as i''d like it to.</td>', 'nice moment, but seems a little soft and flat...doesn''t really pop for me as much as i''d like it to.', '2010-05-06 06:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993944, 877622, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but could really could use a tighter crop.  all that wasted space really takes away.  also, was this really the moment?  or was it taken a half second before the real moment, when all their legs were in the air for that first step?  timing can be all the difference in the world between a good shot and a great shot.</td>', 'nice idea, but could really could use a tighter crop.  all that wasted space really takes away.  also, was this really the moment?  or was it taken a half second before the real moment, when all their legs were in the air for that first step?  timing can be all the difference in the world between a good shot and a great shot.', '2010-05-06 06:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993945, 876758, 15407, '<td valign="top">Catching a fish would be the frosting on this GREAT Photo!</td>', 'Catching a fish would be the frosting on this GREAT Photo!', '2010-05-06 06:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993946, 877620, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but as far as dpc goes, you probably should have tried to get something more focused on a tighter action shot.  love the perspective, though.</td>', 'nice idea, but as far as dpc goes, you probably should have tried to get something more focused on a tighter action shot.  love the perspective, though.', '2010-05-06 06:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993947, 875740, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but a lot of non-contributory dead space on the right.  for people that read titles, this one is probably not helping your score.  i don''t mind the toning, but the image overall seems a little soft.</td>', 'nice idea, but a lot of non-contributory dead space on the right.  for people that read titles, this one is probably not helping your score.  i don''t mind the toning, but the image overall seems a little soft.', '2010-05-06 06:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993948, 878319, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, but doesn''t really scream sports action.  maybe if someone had been casting?</td>', 'beautiful shot, but doesn''t really scream sports action.  maybe if someone had been casting?', '2010-05-06 06:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993949, 877736, 23394, '<td valign="top">really nice idea, but...if that''s what you were after, it''s a shame you couldn''t have gotten something with a little more symmetry, or without his face being so hidden.  these shots are not easy, especially when you have men on base and you have to be ready to shift your focus in a split second.  all the same, if you have something in mind, commit to it and go for it, regardless of what else is going on.  sure, you might miss something, but you have a better chance of getting what you''re after.</td>', 'really nice idea, but...if that''s what you were after, it''s a shame you couldn''t have gotten something with a little more symmetry, or without his face being so hidden.  these shots are not easy, especially when you have men on base and you have to be ready to shift your focus in a split second.  all the same, if you have something in mind, commit to it and go for it, regardless of what else is going on.  sure, you might miss something, but you have a better chance of getting what you''re after.', '2010-05-06 06:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5993950, 876046, 23394, '<td valign="top">i get the idea but it''s not really working for me.  maybe with a little more post-production it wouldn''t look so flat and soft.</td>', 'i get the idea but it''s not really working for me.  maybe with a little more post-production it wouldn''t look so flat and soft.', '2010-05-06 06:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
