(5994031, 877932, 113278, '<td valign="top">Hey ump would you mind stepping out of the way? Great shot man, and don''t worry I''m not taking away any points for the umpire, I know how that goes. This is really good and meets the challenge very well. My only suggestion is when editing look at your horizon and make sure it is straight. I still give this a 9. Nice work and way to anticipate the play.</td>', 'Hey ump would you mind stepping out of the way? Great shot man, and don''t worry I''m not taking away any points for the umpire, I know how that goes. This is really good and meets the challenge very well. My only suggestion is when editing look at your horizon and make sure it is straight. I still give this a 9. Nice work and way to anticipate the play.', '2010-05-06 08:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994033, 876404, 113278, '<td valign="top">Reall nice work here, I would even wager a guess that this may be Matt? Nice tight crop, way to blow out the background to get rid of any distracting element and this seems like a real event and not posed like some seem to be. My personal pick for top 3.</td>', 'Reall nice work here, I would even wager a guess that this may be Matt? Nice tight crop, way to blow out the background to get rid of any distracting element and this seems like a real event and not posed like some seem to be. My personal pick for top 3.', '2010-05-06 08:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
