(5994037, 877745, 113278, '<td valign="top">A classic shot but still captured nice. Not sure I have anything to add to this. While it is a shot you see a lot for this challenge it meets it well, nice tight shot, your horizon is straight and the timing was excellent. 9.</td>', 'A classic shot but still captured nice. Not sure I have anything to add to this. While it is a shot you see a lot for this challenge it meets it well, nice tight shot, your horizon is straight and the timing was excellent. 9.', '2010-05-06 08:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
