(5994395, 878306, 58691, '<td valign="top">Kat, I like your version. I like that it shows motion (the blur is good here), the concentration on his face and the ledge as the anchor of the frame. By comparison, mine stops the motion completely and the wider DOF puts everything in focus. Yours is much more active than mine which is really a freeze-frame. Key to yours is that his face is in focus. WB, or maybe brightness, could be adjuststed a but, but I am looking at it on a laptop. <br/> <br/>No vote, just comment.</td>', 'Kat, I like your version. I like that it shows motion (the blur is good here), the concentration on his face and the ledge as the anchor of the frame. By comparison, mine stops the motion completely and the wider DOF puts everything in focus. Yours is much more active than mine which is really a freeze-frame. Key to yours is that his face is in focus. WB, or maybe brightness, could be adjuststed a but, but I am looking at it on a laptop.  No vote, just comment.', '2010-05-06 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994656, 878444, 47974, '<td valign="top">I am a die hard mtn bike rider so this shot appeals to me.  Nice job of catching the action and I like the sky (kind of dramatic).  The lighting is a little harsh (not much you can do about that, I know)  and the rider is a little soft.  May want to try sharpening it after saving it at the smaller web size (I just learned that trick and it really does make a huge difference).</td>', 'I am a die hard mtn bike rider so this shot appeals to me.  Nice job of catching the action and I like the sky (kind of dramatic).  The lighting is a little harsh (not much you can do about that, I know)  and the rider is a little soft.  May want to try sharpening it after saving it at the smaller web size (I just learned that trick and it really does make a huge difference).', '2010-05-06 19:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994657, 878333, 47974, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this shot.  I know how hard the lighting is in a gym and you did a good job.  Would have liked to seen the top of the heads of the people in the background and think they would have looked better if blurred from your DOF and not motion (faster shutter speed would have helped that).</td>', 'I really like the concept of this shot.  I know how hard the lighting is in a gym and you did a good job.  Would have liked to seen the top of the heads of the people in the background and think they would have looked better if blurred from your DOF and not motion (faster shutter speed would have helped that).', '2010-05-06 19:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5994660, 877856, 47974, '<td valign="top">The point of action you stop is wonderful.  Especially the guy on the right, love his pose.  It appears you have the guy with the ball in focus but it is to dark to really tell for sure.  Overall the photo is to dark.</td>', 'The point of action you stop is wonderful.  Especially the guy on the right, love his pose.  It appears you have the guy with the ball in focus but it is to dark to really tell for sure.  Overall the photo is to dark.', '2010-05-06 19:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
