(5995172, 877606, 115307, '<td valign="top">My favorite thing about sports photography are the expressions that are captured that are just not see in other moments of life. Well done, this one gave me a chuckle :-)</td>', 'My favorite thing about sports photography are the expressions that are captured that are just not see in other moments of life. Well done, this one gave me a chuckle :-)', '2010-05-07 01:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
