(5995321, 878353, 23394, '<td valign="top">yeah, right...<br/> <br/>nice image, wrong venue...<br/> <br/>your image topic is far enough out of the mainstream to make it almost inaccessible to most viewers (meaning it''s a stretch to ask dpc at large to consider balancing on a rope a sport rather than a physical activity).<br/> <br/>but, if that''s what you want to do, you have two options. one, go the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=21714" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">xion</a>/boysetfire/ubique route and explore it abstractly with absolutely no concern for the score, or two, explore it in such a way that you not only capture the imagination of the viewer, but you also educate them immediately as to the physical connection with sport (for instance, a slow-shutter silhouetted shot from a low perspective).<br/> <br/>you took a risk with this, and your score will probably not be your reward. i admire that, as there were any number of things you could have shot that would have been more accessible to the voters.</td>', 'yeah, right... nice image, wrong venue... your image topic is far enough out of the mainstream to make it almost inaccessible to most viewers (meaning it''s a stretch to ask dpc at large to consider balancing on a rope a sport rather than a physical activity). but, if that''s what you want to do, you have two options. one, go the  xion/boysetfire/ubique route and explore it abstractly with absolutely no concern for the score, or two, explore it in such a way that you not only capture the imagination of the viewer, but you also educate them immediately as to the physical connection with sport (for instance, a slow-shutter silhouetted shot from a low perspective). you took a risk with this, and your score will probably not be your reward. i admire that, as there were any number of things you could have shot that would have been more accessible to the voters.', '2010-05-07 07:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
