(5995737, 878019, 108544, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop laughing... lol Love the facial expression of the rider. Actually, the horse is great too.</td>', 'I can''t stop laughing... lol Love the facial expression of the rider. Actually, the horse is great too.', '2010-05-07 13:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5995742, 876555, 108544, '<td valign="top">Great capture! The main action is great and the background guys, add even more "What the #$@!", factor. <br/>Truly a great story of shocking play!</td>', 'Great capture! The main action is great and the background guys, add even more "What the #$@!", factor. Truly a great story of shocking play!', '2010-05-07 13:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5995749, 876770, 108544, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Just such a strange moment in the jump. Almost looks like he wants that pole back!<br/>Nice use of shutter speed and depth of field.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Just such a strange moment in the jump. Almost looks like he wants that pole back!Nice use of shutter speed and depth of field.', '2010-05-07 14:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5995755, 877827, 108544, '<td valign="top">Love the girl in the background. Just such a timid look to here. You can almost feel the impact, from here expression and body language. Nice...</td>', 'Love the girl in the background. Just such a timid look to here. You can almost feel the impact, from here expression and body language. Nice...', '2010-05-07 14:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
