(5995948, 877306, 108069, '<td valign="top">Look out! Great moment to capture. Great expression and emotion. Super sharp. Cropped perfectly. I really like this one.</td>', 'Look out! Great moment to capture. Great expression and emotion. Super sharp. Cropped perfectly. I really like this one.', '2010-05-07 16:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
