(5998170, 876433, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good to see some major league action in this challenge. Nicely done.</td>', 'Good to see some major league action in this challenge. Nicely done.', '2010-05-09 11:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998171, 878423, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely set up. The lighting and focus on the glove, however, seems to be abit off. Would be nice to see more of the textures in the glove.</td>', 'Nicely set up. The lighting and focus on the glove, however, seems to be abit off. Would be nice to see more of the textures in the glove.', '2010-05-09 11:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998172, 876692, 76335, '<td valign="top">Part of me wants to say that the background spectators looking in the opposite direction take something away from this. Another part of me finds humor in it. I like it anyway.</td>', 'Part of me wants to say that the background spectators looking in the opposite direction take something away from this. Another part of me finds humor in it. I like it anyway.', '2010-05-09 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998173, 877064, 76335, '<td valign="top">The tilt away from the direction of the car creates an interesting dynamic.</td>', 'The tilt away from the direction of the car creates an interesting dynamic.', '2010-05-09 11:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998174, 878223, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice cluster of action here that loses nothing in black and white.</td>', 'Nice cluster of action here that loses nothing in black and white.', '2010-05-09 11:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998175, 878441, 76335, '<td valign="top">Typically these blurred scenes work best when the the figure is sharp and background blurred, or vice versa. So this has a different, abstract sort of feel to it. I like it.</td>', 'Typically these blurred scenes work best when the the figure is sharp and background blurred, or vice versa. So this has a different, abstract sort of feel to it. I like it.', '2010-05-09 11:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998178, 878095, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors in this. Good sharpness throughout.</td>', 'Nice rich colors in this. Good sharpness throughout.', '2010-05-09 11:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998183, 878076, 76335, '<td valign="top">Missed focus, missed framing. Nice try, but I can''t help but think that a little more persistence would have paid off.</td>', 'Missed focus, missed framing. Nice try, but I can''t help but think that a little more persistence would have paid off.', '2010-05-09 11:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998184, 876198, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like a ribbon winner to me -- or darn close to it. Beautifully captured.</td>', 'Looks like a ribbon winner to me -- or darn close to it. Beautifully captured.', '2010-05-09 11:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998185, 878225, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice action. Did you run noise reduction? If so, it feels like a bit much. I''m not seeing any fine texture.</td>', 'Nice action. Did you run noise reduction? If so, it feels like a bit much. I''m not seeing any fine texture.', '2010-05-09 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998187, 878108, 76335, '<td valign="top">The splash has a twofold purpose the way I see it -- it shows us a lot of action, and the way you framed it, it separates the vehicle from the background. Good work.</td>', 'The splash has a twofold purpose the way I see it -- it shows us a lot of action, and the way you framed it, it separates the vehicle from the background. Good work.', '2010-05-09 11:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998188, 877306, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action. The face really suggests intensity, concentration...</td>', 'Nice stop action. The face really suggests intensity, concentration...', '2010-05-09 11:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998215, 877710, 76335, '<td valign="top">So many puns, so little time.</td>', 'So many puns, so little time.', '2010-05-09 11:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998216, 877827, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good action, although the way they''re crowded together, it took me a second to figure out what was going on.</td>', 'Good action, although the way they''re crowded together, it took me a second to figure out what was going on.', '2010-05-09 11:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998217, 875760, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous stop action capture!</td>', 'Fabulous stop action capture!', '2010-05-09 11:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998220, 878343, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit for dramatic effect.</td>', 'Beautifully lit for dramatic effect.', '2010-05-09 11:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998221, 878252, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting environment. I''m not sure yet how I feel about the tilt.</td>', 'Interesting environment. I''m not sure yet how I feel about the tilt.', '2010-05-09 11:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998222, 878097, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good job freezing the action. Nicely framed too.</td>', 'Good job freezing the action. Nicely framed too.', '2010-05-09 11:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998223, 878324, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed. I like the blur.</td>', 'Beautifully composed. I like the blur.', '2010-05-09 11:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998224, 877884, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good, but a little more head room would have been nice.</td>', 'Good, but a little more head room would have been nice.', '2010-05-09 11:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998225, 878012, 76335, '<td valign="top">Something different. I like how you''ve composed this, and the placement of the focus. (Looks very familiar actually<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=873817" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">...</a>)</td>', 'Something different. I like how you''ve composed this, and the placement of the focus. (Looks very familiar actually...)', '2010-05-09 11:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998226, 877191, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. The DOF and lighting is perfect. Good strong color too.</td>', 'Nicely composed. The DOF and lighting is perfect. Good strong color too.', '2010-05-09 11:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998228, 877984, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great storytelling with this.</td>', 'Great storytelling with this.', '2010-05-09 11:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998236, 876452, 37845, '<td valign="top">Good luck Nick :)</td>', 'Good luck Nick :)', '2010-05-09 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998237, 877745, 37845, '<td valign="top">Good Luck David :)</td>', 'Good Luck David :)', '2010-05-09 12:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998261, 877624, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really like the angle, the processing, the slow shutter.  Captures the essence of the grind of a marathon - not the front runners, but those who simply push along the whole way, doing their personal best.  One of my top three.</td>', 'Really like the angle, the processing, the slow shutter.  Captures the essence of the grind of a marathon - not the front runners, but those who simply push along the whole way, doing their personal best.  One of my top three.', '2010-05-09 12:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998262, 877245, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of light - really captures the essence of beach volleyball.  One of my top three.</td>', 'Wonderful use of light - really captures the essence of beach volleyball.  One of my top three.', '2010-05-09 12:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998264, 877821, 30982, '<td valign="top">The angle, the light, the slowish shutter, the monochrome all serve this very well.  Nice essence of the pickup game.  No bells and whistles, no slick advertising, just a little bit of basketball.  One of my top three.</td>', 'The angle, the light, the slowish shutter, the monochrome all serve this very well.  Nice essence of the pickup game.  No bells and whistles, no slick advertising, just a little bit of basketball.  One of my top three.', '2010-05-09 12:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998312, 877710, 30861, '<td valign="top">Penny, well aware that I''m a fanatic golfer, said "There''s a naked golfer entered!" This was before I had started viewing the sports entries. My response to that was "That''s not a visual I want in my head..."<br/> <br/>But of course I had to go look...<br/> <br/>And I''m amazed, this is a beautiful, beautiful image. In perfectly good taste, immaculately well captured. It''s vaguely reminiscent of a Muybridge; I don''t know if that was intentional.<br/> <br/>A 9 from me :-)<br/> <br/>Okay, bumped to 10. Best image in the challenge :-)</td>', 'Penny, well aware that I''m a fanatic golfer, said "There''s a naked golfer entered!" This was before I had started viewing the sports entries. My response to that was "That''s not a visual I want in my head..." But of course I had to go look... And I''m amazed, this is a beautiful, beautiful image. In perfectly good taste, immaculately well captured. It''s vaguely reminiscent of a Muybridge; I don''t know if that was intentional. A 9 from me :-) Okay, bumped to 10. Best image in the challenge :-)', '2010-05-09 14:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998319, 877932, 76335, '<td valign="top">You must have had good seats. Good major league action...</td>', 'You must have had good seats. Good major league action...', '2010-05-09 14:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998324, 878237, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ouch! Interesting take on the challenge theme.</td>', 'Ouch! Interesting take on the challenge theme.', '2010-05-09 14:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998363, 877651, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice panoramic view thought the action feels a bit far away.</td>', 'Nice panoramic view thought the action feels a bit far away.', '2010-05-09 15:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998367, 878016, 76335, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s something different, but nothing here is in sharp focus.</td>', 'Yes, it''s something different, but nothing here is in sharp focus.', '2010-05-09 15:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998369, 878444, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the opposing diagonals between the biker and the rock.</td>', 'I like the opposing diagonals between the biker and the rock.', '2010-05-09 15:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998372, 875981, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, good subject isolation.</td>', 'Nicely composed, good subject isolation.', '2010-05-09 15:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998394, 878382, 76335, '<td valign="top">Seriously good frozen action.</td>', 'Seriously good frozen action.', '2010-05-09 16:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998396, 878400, 76335, '<td valign="top">WOuld like to see a bit more detail in the waves. They''re mostly blown out.</td>', 'WOuld like to see a bit more detail in the waves. They''re mostly blown out.', '2010-05-09 16:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998397, 875992, 76335, '<td valign="top">Seriously good. The pose is out of this world. I like the low contrast too.</td>', 'Seriously good. The pose is out of this world. I like the low contrast too.', '2010-05-09 16:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998408, 878106, 76335, '<td valign="top">I wish it were a bit sharper. I do like the strong contrast and rich colors though.</td>', 'I wish it were a bit sharper. I do like the strong contrast and rich colors though.', '2010-05-09 16:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998415, 878333, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like she''s been benched. Great storytelling with this.</td>', 'Looks like she''s been benched. Great storytelling with this.', '2010-05-09 17:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998421, 877959, 76335, '<td valign="top">It took a second for this to register, but I think it''s cool. A good idea, well conceived and executed.</td>', 'It took a second for this to register, but I think it''s cool. A good idea, well conceived and executed.', '2010-05-09 17:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998491, 877624, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the blur and the very low perspective. I suspect some might ding this entry for the building being more of the scene than the runners, but I think the prominence of the building sets a strong context and local flavor for the scene. Probably a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a> entry, given the stated location and street photography style.</td>', 'I like the use of the blur and the very low perspective. I suspect some might ding this entry for the building being more of the scene than the runners, but I think the prominence of the building sets a strong context and local flavor for the scene. Probably a  bvy entry, given the stated location and street photography style.', '2010-05-09 18:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998496, 878336, 83313, '<td valign="top">Heard about this on the news (Who didn''t?). You certainly captured a moment!</td>', 'Heard about this on the news (Who didn''t?). You certainly captured a moment!', '2010-05-09 18:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998508, 878380, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog laughs! Fighting with soft pillows on hands is not fight at all. How you kill enemy with soft hand-pillows? Should use clubs, like real warriors. Winner takes all of losers females. That is <b>real</b> fight for real warriors, with real reward. (OK, Grog admits that sometimes extra females can be punishment...)</td>', 'Grog laughs! Fighting with soft pillows on hands is not fight at all. How you kill enemy with soft hand-pillows? Should use clubs, like real warriors. Winner takes all of losers females. That is real fight for real warriors, with real reward. (OK, Grog admits that sometimes extra females can be punishment...)', '2010-05-09 18:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998515, 877245, 103310, '<td valign="top">Photograph too dark. No more drawing in the deep black.</td>', 'Photograph too dark. No more drawing in the deep black.', '2010-05-09 18:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998518, 878245, 103310, '<td valign="top">Very special. Very good graphic reproduction. Beautiful silhouette with beautiful context colour.</td>', 'Very special. Very good graphic reproduction. Beautiful silhouette with beautiful context colour.', '2010-05-09 18:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5998521, 878383, 103310, '<td valign="top">Delicious photograph of a beautiful moment. Sharpen in picture.  Small minus point is that the elbow there net does not stand up. But you get certainly a high score.</td>', 'Delicious photograph of a beautiful moment. Sharpen in picture.  Small minus point is that the elbow there net does not stand up. But you get certainly a high score.', '2010-05-09 18:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
