(6002632, 878320, 30861, '<td valign="top">I meant to leave you a comment in voting, but got distracted and never did. I gave this a 9, and was hoping it would ribbon. Awesome shot Skip!</td>', 'I meant to leave you a comment in voting, but got distracted and never did. I gave this a 9, and was hoping it would ribbon. Awesome shot Skip!', '2010-05-12 02:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6002642, 877985, 30861, '<td valign="top">I kinda thought this might be yours, when I scoped out the location :-) It''s a fine shot. But, for the record, ALL sailors use wind, so "wind sailors" is sort of redundant. What they actually are is "windsurfers" or "boardsailors"; started as the former, years ago, but the latter is much more common usage now :-)<br/> <br/>I''m a former sailmaker so I know this stuff, see...? I''m so danged pedantic.... :-)</td>', 'I kinda thought this might be yours, when I scoped out the location :-) It''s a fine shot. But, for the record, ALL sailors use wind, so "wind sailors" is sort of redundant. What they actually are is "windsurfers" or "boardsailors"; started as the former, years ago, but the latter is much more common usage now :-) I''m a former sailmaker so I know this stuff, see...? I''m so danged pedantic.... :-)', '2010-05-12 02:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6002645, 876570, 17126, '<td valign="top">trying to figure out how this looks overexposed. cuz it doesn''t. awesome job.</td>', 'trying to figure out how this looks overexposed. cuz it doesn''t. awesome job.', '2010-05-12 02:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
