(6002778, 878044, 32011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on winning the cup dude... I assume this was when you were out of action b/c of injury?  There''s a lot going on in this image, i.e too many distractions from what you want the viewer looking at, the ball.  Tighter crop would have really helped this... IMHO</td>', 'Congratulations on winning the cup dude... I assume this was when you were out of action b/c of injury?  There''s a lot going on in this image, i.e too many distractions from what you want the viewer looking at, the ball.  Tighter crop would have really helped this... IMHO', '2010-05-12 03:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
