(6003518, 878343, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is a FABULOUS photo!  Can you imagine a senior baseball player getting a photo like this for his senior pictures?  I know if my baseball player had been able to get a senior photo like this back in the day, it would be an enormous gallery print in our game room.  Congratulations on the ribbon, and I agree with you about it being just perfect for this challenge!<br/></td>', 'Wow!  This is a FABULOUS photo!  Can you imagine a senior baseball player getting a photo like this for his senior pictures?  I know if my baseball player had been able to get a senior photo like this back in the day, it would be an enormous gallery print in our game room.  Congratulations on the ribbon, and I agree with you about it being just perfect for this challenge!', '2010-05-12 09:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
