(6003975, 878440, 110327, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback.  I agree with the poster who suggested a tighter crop, and I messed up by fat fingering when I saved it for the web - I had a couple hundred more pixels to use - I was in a hurry to beat the deadline.  I would also have liked a shallower DOF but at F4, my 70-200 F4 that''s about as good as I could get it from the dugout.  I''ll have to rent the F2.8 and I have a feeling I''ll end up trading in my F4.  That''s my daughter playing first, so personally I don''t think she''s distracting at all :-)<br/>I''m very pleased as this is my first try and I was hoping to be in the top half.  There are some great photographers on this site.  I''ve enjoyed your pictures, I''ve learned from you already, and I look forward to learning a lot more.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the feedback.  I agree with the poster who suggested a tighter crop, and I messed up by fat fingering when I saved it for the web - I had a couple hundred more pixels to use - I was in a hurry to beat the deadline.  I would also have liked a shallower DOF but at F4, my 70-200 F4 that''s about as good as I could get it from the dugout.  I''ll have to rent the F2.8 and I have a feeling I''ll end up trading in my F4.  That''s my daughter playing first, so personally I don''t think she''s distracting at all :-)I''m very pleased as this is my first try and I was hoping to be in the top half.  There are some great photographers on this site.  I''ve enjoyed your pictures, I''ve learned from you already, and I look forward to learning a lot more. ', '2010-05-12 13:20:01.000000', NULL, 0),
