(6004110, 877611, 73575, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JokersSoul:</b></div><hr/><i> The color of the water is gorgeous. The action is good. The surfer needs to be more in focus in my opinion. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Agreed on the water, but I actually like him just a little blurry - pulls the attention to the right side of the wave, which is just beautiful.</td>', 'Originally posted by JokersSoul: The color of the water is gorgeous. The action is good. The surfer needs to be more in focus in my opinion.  Agreed on the water, but I actually like him just a little blurry - pulls the attention to the right side of the wave, which is just beautiful.', '2010-05-12 14:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
