(6006907, 877306, 45524, '<td valign="top">I voted this a 5. <br/> <br/>The image had some real potential especially based on the amount of pixels you had to start with. To me the catcher and all the dead space in between the two players does nothing for this photo. take a nice vertical crop of the batter with the ball in the air, it eliminates the dead space and the distractions in the background and you have a much stronger image. And yes the timing could be a touch better, but there is still the sense of anticipation and action to it that draws the viewer in.</td>', 'I voted this a 5.  The image had some real potential especially based on the amount of pixels you had to start with. To me the catcher and all the dead space in between the two players does nothing for this photo. take a nice vertical crop of the batter with the ball in the air, it eliminates the dead space and the distractions in the background and you have a much stronger image. And yes the timing could be a touch better, but there is still the sense of anticipation and action to it that draws the viewer in.', '2010-05-14 10:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6007060, 876555, 61961, '<td valign="top">Well, you got a ton of 6s, and more 7s than 5s, so... not too bad. :-)<br/> <br/>Sometimes I wonder if voters have their own rules of thumb.  My guess is that the blocked face (eyes) cost you some points.</td>', 'Well, you got a ton of 6s, and more 7s than 5s, so... not too bad. :-) Sometimes I wonder if voters have their own rules of thumb.  My guess is that the blocked face (eyes) cost you some points.', '2010-05-14 12:05:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6007872, 875981, 17186, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by light_weaver:</b></div><hr/><i> drugs and sports don''t mix </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>guess you don''t like any professional sports then? this surfer looks fit! big ol'' arms! multicolored weed stickers are apparently not making this guy eat too many cheetos<br/> <br/>oh yeah... off of the soapbox...<br/> <br/>i love the intense look of concentration of the surfer in the midst of the chaotic splash of the water<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-05-15 01:17:31.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by light_weaver: drugs and sports don''t mix   guess you don''t like any professional sports then? this surfer looks fit! big ol'' arms! multicolored weed stickers are apparently not making this guy eat too many cheetos oh yeah... off of the soapbox... i love the intense look of concentration of the surfer in the midst of the chaotic splash of the water', '2010-05-15 02:15:28.000000', '2010-05-15 02:17:31.000000', 0),
